{"title":"Git 标签","date":"2024-10-01T16:00:00.000Z","toc":false,"summary":"","source":"_posts/软件测试/工具流/Git/Git_标签.md","raw":"---\ntitle: Git 标签\ntags: [Git, 工具相关]\nsummary: \"\"\ntoc: false\ncopyright: \"\"\ndate: 2024-10-02\n---\n\n## 标签\n\ntag就是一个让人容易记住的有意义的名字，它跟某个commit绑在一起。\n\n### 新建一个标签\n\n```bash\ngit tag <tagname>\n```\n\n命令`git tag <tagname>`用于新建一个标签，默认为HEAD，也可以指定一个commit id。\n\n### 指定标签信息\n\nyou can use like this: `git tag -a <tagname> -m \"say something...\"`\n\n```bash\ngit tag -a <tagname> -m <description> <branchname> or commit_id\n```\n\n\n### PGP签名标签\n\nyou can use like this: `git tag -s <tagname> -m \"say something...\"`\n\n```bash\ngit tag -s <tagname> -m <description> <branchname> or commit_id\n```\n\n### 查看所有标签\n\n```bash\ngit tag\n```\n\n### 推送一个本地标签\n\n```bash\ngit push origin <tagname>\n```\n\n### 推送全部未推送过的本地标签\n\n```bash\ngit push origin --tags\n```\n\n### 删除一个本地标签\n\n```bash\ngit tag -d <tagname>\n```\n\n### 删除一个远程标签\n\n```bash\ngit push origin :refs/tags/<tagname>\n```\n","slug":"软件测试/工具流/Git/Git_标签","published":true,"updated":"2024-10-01T16:00:00.000Z","_id":"cmcg7o5xt002iprqbh6da9b04","comments":true,"layout":"post","photos":[],"html":"<h2 id=\"标签\"><a href=\"#标签\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"标签\"></a>标签</h2><p>tag就是一个让人容易记住的有意义的名字，它跟某个commit绑在一起。</p>\n<h3 id=\"新建一个标签\"><a href=\"#新建一个标签\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"新建一个标签\"></a>新建一个标签</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git tag &lt;tagname&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>命令<code>git tag &lt;tagname&gt;</code>用于新建一个标签，默认为HEAD，也可以指定一个commit id。</p>\n<h3 id=\"指定标签信息\"><a href=\"#指定标签信息\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"指定标签信息\"></a>指定标签信息</h3><p>you can use like this: <code>git tag -a &lt;tagname&gt; -m &quot;say something...&quot;</code></p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git tag -a &lt;tagname&gt; -m &lt;description&gt; &lt;branchname&gt; or commit_id</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n\n<h3 id=\"PGP签名标签\"><a href=\"#PGP签名标签\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"PGP签名标签\"></a>PGP签名标签</h3><p>you can use like this: <code>git tag -s &lt;tagname&gt; -m &quot;say something...&quot;</code></p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git tag -s &lt;tagname&gt; -m &lt;description&gt; &lt;branchname&gt; or commit_id</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"查看所有标签\"><a href=\"#查看所有标签\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"查看所有标签\"></a>查看所有标签</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git tag</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"推送一个本地标签\"><a href=\"#推送一个本地标签\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"推送一个本地标签\"></a>推送一个本地标签</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git push origin &lt;tagname&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"推送全部未推送过的本地标签\"><a href=\"#推送全部未推送过的本地标签\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"推送全部未推送过的本地标签\"></a>推送全部未推送过的本地标签</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git push origin --tags</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"删除一个本地标签\"><a href=\"#删除一个本地标签\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"删除一个本地标签\"></a>删除一个本地标签</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git tag -d &lt;tagname&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"删除一个远程标签\"><a href=\"#删除一个远程标签\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"删除一个远程标签\"></a>删除一个远程标签</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git push origin :refs/tags/&lt;tagname&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n","excerpt":"","more":"<h2 id=\"标签\"><a href=\"#标签\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"标签\"></a>标签</h2><p>tag就是一个让人容易记住的有意义的名字，它跟某个commit绑在一起。</p>\n<h3 id=\"新建一个标签\"><a href=\"#新建一个标签\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"新建一个标签\"></a>新建一个标签</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git tag &lt;tagname&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>命令<code>git tag &lt;tagname&gt;</code>用于新建一个标签，默认为HEAD，也可以指定一个commit id。</p>\n<h3 id=\"指定标签信息\"><a href=\"#指定标签信息\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"指定标签信息\"></a>指定标签信息</h3><p>you can use like this: <code>git tag -a &lt;tagname&gt; -m &quot;say something...&quot;</code></p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git tag -a &lt;tagname&gt; -m &lt;description&gt; &lt;branchname&gt; or commit_id</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n\n<h3 id=\"PGP签名标签\"><a href=\"#PGP签名标签\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"PGP签名标签\"></a>PGP签名标签</h3><p>you can use like this: <code>git tag -s &lt;tagname&gt; -m &quot;say something...&quot;</code></p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git tag -s &lt;tagname&gt; -m &lt;description&gt; &lt;branchname&gt; or commit_id</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"查看所有标签\"><a href=\"#查看所有标签\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"查看所有标签\"></a>查看所有标签</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git tag</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"推送一个本地标签\"><a href=\"#推送一个本地标签\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"推送一个本地标签\"></a>推送一个本地标签</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git push origin &lt;tagname&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"推送全部未推送过的本地标签\"><a href=\"#推送全部未推送过的本地标签\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"推送全部未推送过的本地标签\"></a>推送全部未推送过的本地标签</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git push origin --tags</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"删除一个本地标签\"><a href=\"#删除一个本地标签\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"删除一个本地标签\"></a>删除一个本地标签</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git tag -d &lt;tagname&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"删除一个远程标签\"><a href=\"#删除一个远程标签\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"删除一个远程标签\"></a>删除一个远程标签</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git push origin :refs/tags/&lt;tagname&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n","path":"2024/10/软件测试/工具流/Git/Git_标签/","permalink":"http://example.com/2024/10/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E6%B5%81/Git/Git_%E6%A0%87%E7%AD%BE/","tags":[{"name":"工具相关","_id":"cmcg7o5xe001gprqbe22f53hg","slug":"工具相关","path":"tags/工具相关/","permalink":"http://example.com/tags/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3/","length":17},{"name":"Git","_id":"cmcg7o5ys005jprqbf0138qp9","slug":"Git","path":"tags/Git/","permalink":"http://example.com/tags/Git/"